+//  kptr   the kopt routed block-rows, paired block-rows, IQ4_NL packed and Q8 packed decode kernels (routed experts,
+//         shared-expert down) take their binding pointers resolved on the host instead of indexing the captured pointer
+//         array by descriptor fields inside the kernel; the arithmetic is unchanged (kernels.cpp KPSEL). Non-routed
