+//         compile time, so group()'s branches and slot selects are constants (native.cpp).
+//  moec   decode: a cnorm pair (OWNRT_HC_KERNELS) whose combine reads the moe_combine launched directly before it also
+//         takes that moe site's mixture epilogue and moe_combine into its launch (hc_kernels norm_row_moe; generic_engine).
